Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:03.61,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,相信笼中安全
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.75,0:02:05.37,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,深信此为绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.41,0:02:07.71,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至忘却创作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:10.50,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,那位置配不上光明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.97,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,说出希望 抛下不满
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.97,0:02:14.86,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,拉起革命的旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:19.40,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,去任何人无法赶上的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:25.41,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,终有一天 超越修罗之外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:28.02,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,即使现在被压制
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.10,0:02:30.89,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,使我的卧薪尝胆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.97,0:02:35.49,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,也不会被夺走梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:38.34,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,燃烧吧全身神经
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:43.08,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道向谁传达的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:48.26,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,没有寄托意义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:53.78,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,向着更光明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:57.82,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,到达顶点为止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.84,0:03:00.38,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,have an obsession for victory
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:03.00,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm proud of myself and you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.06,0:03:05.88,shokugeki_opch,NTP,0,0,0,,we must be the change we wish to see
