Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:57.79,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}青天響く霹靂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:23:01.15,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}閃光眩むその間に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:04.80,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}決して音を立てずに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:08.33,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}じっと忍び寄る影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:11.92,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}騙し騙されて 失った
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:15.37,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}罵り罵られて 奪った
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.56,0:23:19.40,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}守りべき正義をすり減らして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.52,0:23:22.76,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}勝ち取るものなどない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.85,0:23:26.43,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}籠の中から見上げた空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.59,0:23:30.00,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}雨上がりの青の眩しさに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:33.43,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}囚われたままじゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:36.92,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}昔話なら捨てて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:40.48,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明日が言うべきは他でもない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:44.15,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}突き動かすほどの本能だ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.31,0:23:47.55,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}ぼくはぼくじゃなきゃ居られない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.55,0:23:50.77,shokugeki_edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}変われるほど器用じゃないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:57.79,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}响彻云霄的霹雳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:23:01.15,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被闪光晕眩之时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.66,0:23:04.80,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}绝对不要发出声响
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:08.33,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}一动不动地忍受悄然靠近的影子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:11.92,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}尔虞我诈 难免失去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.02,0:23:15.37,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}争吵不断 相互夺取
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.56,0:23:19.40,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}本应守护的正义慢慢衰退
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.52,0:23:22.76,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}便无法赢取任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.85,0:23:26.43,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}从笼中向上仰视的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.59,0:23:30.00,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}被雨后的蓝色所闪耀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:33.43,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}不会就此甘愿被囚禁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.43,0:23:36.92,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}旧事都一并丢弃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:40.48,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}明天要畅谈的东西没有别的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:44.15,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}是几乎拉扯我前进的本能
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.31,0:23:47.55,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}我不管什么时候都必须是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.55,0:23:50.77,shokugeki_edch,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)}因为我并不擅于改变
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:05.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,楠莲太郎VS黑木场凉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:07.79,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,食戟开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:13.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 鲑鱼一瞬间就
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:15.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,手法那么豪迈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:17.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,处理却非常纤细
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,黑木场君
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:22.09,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,变得比在秋季选拔赛中和我对决的时候更厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,楠前辈也
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和黑木场的刀工仲伯难分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:31.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中枢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:36.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,果然每个人都具备顶级技术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:38.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？黑木场君
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:39.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈我的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.45,0:00:42.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不要后悔接受比赛了哟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:44.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那就太扫兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.49,0:00:46.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:48.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,米吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.62,0:00:51.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且有两种？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:53.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,再加上那个碗里的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:54.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,面团
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:57.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,到底想要做什么啊 黑木场少年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:59.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是现在的我能做出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:02.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,最棒的鲑鱼料理
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:04.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不能输哦 凉君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.67,0:01:06.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？中枢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:08.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,目前为止不只是模仿我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:10.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,还一脸臭屁的样子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:13.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,全力放马过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.91,0:01:15.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,摆精英架子的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:19.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说想要给自己找个失败的理由？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:22.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,幸平和阿尔迪尼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:25.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你也很让人火大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:31.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 我会让你看看我的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:35.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和我可爱的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:37.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.97,0:01:41.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,看清楚了 杂鱼厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:18.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\fad(450,0)\bord0\c&H000000&\blur15\fscx518\fscy183\pos(159,333.999)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:18.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(450,0)\fs90\pos(361,343)}鲑鱼{\fs60}在{\fs90}舞{\fs60}动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:18.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,今天B会场的食戟已经全部结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中枢获得全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:22.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,全部录下来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,录了 很精彩的比赛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:27.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,十杰第六席纪之国宁宁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:30.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\fad(450,0)\bord0\c&H000000&\blur19.5\fscx518\fscy183\pos(1398.999,843.999)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:30.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\fad(450,0)\bord0\c&H000000&\blur19.5\fscx418\fscy183\pos(1417.001,942)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:30.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(450,0)\pos(1583,844.999)}远月十杰第六席
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:30.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(450,0)\pos(1583,943.001)}纪之国宁宁
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:30.27,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比一色前辈还靠前的席次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.66,0:03:33.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,现在二年级里最强的厨师
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\c&H000000&\alpha&H60&\blur19.5\fscx995\fscy441\pos(576.999,813.999)}m 39 0 b 39 -6 115.5 -6 115.5 0 b 115.5 7.5 39 6 39 0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:39.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\pos(960,780)}与此同时 A会场食戟全部结束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:41.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧 这么多同好会 小组 都食戟挑战了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:43.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一局都没有赢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:47.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 这样不就正中薙切蓟的下怀了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:51.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(0,450)\pos(960,815.4)}与此同时 C会场最终战进行中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.11,0:03:52.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我见过那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,秋季选拔赛正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.29,0:03:56.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和薙切爱丽丝的对战
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:58.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,蒸汽对流烤箱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:00.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和冻结粉碎机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,楠莲太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:07.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是也能将最新锐机器运用自如呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:11.75,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易有那么多观众
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:16.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就让你来做我出名的陪衬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,蒸汽昆布？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:20.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是蒸汽组合烤箱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:22.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,通过内部的风扇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:25.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,使热力和蒸汽强制对流的烤箱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.40,0:04:28.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用数据控制自动操作热气和蒸汽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:31.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一台机器就可以完成几乎所有的加热工序
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:32.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是划时代式的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:34.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因为不会串味
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,也可以同时加热不同的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗 很便利嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:42.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然说对于料理人的可以说是梦想中的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:45.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因为可能的选项太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:47.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,理解不深刻的话没办法掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:50.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,对于是否具有食材和料理方法的知识量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:52.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,也是一种考验
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:55.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的确有点意外
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:59.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那个前辈会用那么复杂的机器吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:02.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉他到处放气场 还吊儿郎当的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:03.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,创真君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:06.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的确 一点都看不出来有头脑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:09.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到他居然在最尖端的技术方面有造诣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,连塔克米君也
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:14.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是直言不讳呢 你们很棒棒哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:18.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 如果在意的话就好好看着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:20.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小莲的料理的厉害程度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:22.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开始就可以显现出了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:26.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,取下来的去骨鱼肉放到腌制酱汁里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:28.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,切成棒装
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:30.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用培根卷起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:33.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,想要增加脂肪和盐分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:35.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,蒸汽烤箱出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:39.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,为了内部温度达到45℃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:42.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,60℃加热18分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.66,0:05:45.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小莲是掌握火候的专家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,尤其是低温烹调的手法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.01,0:05:50.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:52.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,低温料理？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:54.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,肉和鱼之类的蛋白质
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:56.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,从58℃开始凝固
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:57.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,变成加热状态
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:06:09.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正大黑_GBK\frz309.2\bord4.5\c&H1D1D22&\3c&HF3F0F2&\move(1198.8,202.2,1206,900.6)}肉质变硬          低温烹调                   食物中毒之类的细菌活动温度
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:02.87,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,然后到了68℃以后体积就会收缩变硬
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:07.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,所以58℃到68℃之间加热的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:09.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就不会给食材增加压力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:12.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲜嫩柔软地完成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.09,0:06:12.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:15.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是低温烹饪基本的思路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:17.62,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:23.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,蒸汽组合烤箱 恒温水槽 循环水槽 低真空烹饪机
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:27.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,操纵各种各样最尖端加热机器的料理人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:28.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是小莲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:31.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,楠 莲太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:34.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,火候 全部掌控了火候的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:36.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的领域都可以一战
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:38.37,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,热和火
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.63,0:06:41.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用这技术达到顶点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:47.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,终于看起来集中了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:49.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦到了食材的加热的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:51.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,突然就会冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:56.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像一直在喧嚣的热度静静地移进料理中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:03.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,多 多么美丽的光泽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.19,0:07:07.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和加热之前仿佛是两种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:10.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,只是看看都可以感受到柔软
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,应该变成了只是接触餐刀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.05,0:07:19.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就会分开的究极口感
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:21.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,前所未有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:24.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是把灵魂注入料理一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是刮目相看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:28.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是超厉害的料理人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉曼德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:33.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉曼德?那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:36.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉名字超酷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:39.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中世纪欧洲的传说中登场的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:41.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在火焰中生存的蜥蜴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉曼蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:42.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs52.5\pos(960,1002.6)}Salamander
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是名字的由来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:45.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不是从下加热
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:48.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,从上方加热的烹饪机器的总称
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 萨拉曼德吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是既可以表面烤出焦黄色
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:55.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,又能增加香味的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:58.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说 烹饪已经进入了最后阶段了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:03.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:06.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就取名叫「salmon Confit Flamme」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:09.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,Flamme在法语中是火的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:12.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,沉溺在火的艺术中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.33,0:08:15.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是楠莲太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:18.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,中枢挖掘的人才做的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:21.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,对了对了 桃前辈也尝尝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:22.88,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么给小桃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:28.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这道菜加入了点心的技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:29.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,甜品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:32.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.31,0:08:34.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这是在向小桃挑战吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,小桃对甜点可是很挑剔的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:39.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,先手 楠莲太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.18,0:08:39.90,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,现在开始品尝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:40.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:46.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 闪耀着光泽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:49.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,被烤制的油脂的香味
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:52.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,外表和香味都还合格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.49,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,美味让人眼花缭乱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:06.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,里面是和生的时候一样醇厚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:10.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,同时 外侧使用萨拉曼德烤出如同演出的香味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:13.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,火候的艺术 就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:16.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,还 还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.82,0:09:19.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那接下来和这个组合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:22.61,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.69,0:09:26.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是没有加过砂糖的鲑鱼的冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:27.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:28.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:30.20,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼的冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:31.38,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:33.98,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,冻结粉碎机 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:35.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是 小爱丽丝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:38.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用碎肉机打成糊状
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,冻结好后放入冻结粉碎机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.86,0:09:43.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,内部的刀片高速旋转
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:46.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就做成了极其细腻的冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:48.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,吃过这个冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,与经过缓慢加热的鲑鱼的温和
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:52.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,形成了鲜明的对比
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不同温度的鲑鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.87,0:09:57.77,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在舌头上相互提高存在感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:09:59.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,thermal sense
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:02.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,秋季选拔赛的时候薙切爱丽丝用过的手法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.01,0:10:05.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,温度 火候 还有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:08.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都是我的调味料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.47,0:10:13.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的确不一样的温度会使素材的味道衬托到最高
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:16.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在冰冷的清流中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:18.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼迸发出火热的生命力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在我的体内快速穿梭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:26.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 已经没有办法避开鲑鱼的攻击了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:28.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不能「鲑」避
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.35,0:10:33.69,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,已经成定局了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:35.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这场比赛也是中枢方面的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,楠莲太郎取得压倒性胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.96,0:10:39.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,决定胜负之前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:42.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,先看看我的料理再说
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我的鲑鱼料理
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼烤饼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.12,0:10:51.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼烤饼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:57.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好安静呐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:11.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能将现在的远月从蓟殿手中拯救出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:14.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定就是那个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:20.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:24.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 只有薙切君一个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:27.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道大家都去哪了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:34.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,吓得我的心脏差点要跳出来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:36.67,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么？喂 薙切君？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.33,0:11:39.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 大家都去侦察了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:44.68,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,的确现在爱丽丝参加的食戟应该已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.87,0:11:47.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 爱丽丝她 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.17,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,想知道现场的样子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:54.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼烤饼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:59.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 所以才会准备面团啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:00.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那是种什么料理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:02.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那是把鲑鱼 大米之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:04.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,塞进奶油面包的面皮里烤制的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:08.80,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是起源于十九世纪俄罗斯宫廷的法式料理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.05,0:12:15.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,还会把蘑菇 荞头等蔬菜和谷物作为馅料加进去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:19.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他的那两种米分别是黄油米饭和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:23.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,东欧的食用谷物 用炒荞麦果实制成的「卡莎」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:28.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,又脆又香的面皮和鲑鱼的香气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:33.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,黄油米饭和卡莎混合在一起的断面真是多汁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:36.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,别在那里喋喋不休了 快趁热吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.25,0:12:39.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这道鲑鱼料理在味道上的爆发力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:43.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是舌头无法抗拒的绝对的美味
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:54.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃到说不出话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:58.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,奶油面包面皮将里面的馅料的美味紧紧锁住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:13:02.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这是把作为主角的鲑鱼 大米 荞麦 蔬菜 面包
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.19,0:13:04.73,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,都浓缩到一起的菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:08.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼极致的鲜味在横冲直撞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:14.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这份量感 直击脑顶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:16.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,想吃吃看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:19.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我擅自取过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.85,0:13:20.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:23.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:31.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,在面皮中凝聚的鲑鱼能量放出强烈的一击
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.77,0:13:32.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.93,0:13:35.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,被这种威力直击的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是避不开的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:45.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:48.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,挺能干的嘛 黑木场
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:51.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,将华丽的宫廷料理的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:57.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,与令海港男儿屈服的黑木场的本领完美地融合到一起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.71,0:14:03.29,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这道菜品应该也是在那两个人的相互竞争中诞生出来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.44,0:14:05.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那么结果到底是哪边赢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:07.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,胜者是楠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.31,0:14:08.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是黑木场？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:11.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 请判定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:18.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不相上下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:21.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,分不清哪道菜更胜一筹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:24.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得两个人都端出了最棒的鲑鱼料理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:30.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,别猴急 再吃一次就能分出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:33.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,两者的菜品具有决定性的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:34.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,决定性的差距？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:38.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明两个人好像都端出了最棒的菜品？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:41.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,审查中最需要注意的地方是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼的美味能保留到何种程度
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.93,0:14:47.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说有一边的菜品中还有什么隐藏起来的秘密吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:52.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,大概说的就是小连使用的蒸汽对流机里的那个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:55.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得审查员也注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:58.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是敏锐呢 芽亚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:14:59.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,答案就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:02.56,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,看着像是橄榄油
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.30,0:15:07.26,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,两人的菜品中起决定性差距的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:10.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是鲑鱼肉中所含有的水分对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:13.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把鲑鱼用保鲜膜包起来低温烹煮的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.93,0:15:17.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是浸在橄榄油中加热的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:18.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鱼在进行一般的烤制时
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.86,0:15:21.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就算用保鲜膜包得很紧密
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:27.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何鱼的精华都会被食材本身的重量压出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.95,0:15:29.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我就用这个橄榄油
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:31.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,由于油的浮力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:34.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就能在消除食材重量对自身的影响的情况下进行加热
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:37.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不放过鲑鱼肉中的任何一滴水分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.17,0:15:38.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,对 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.29,0:15:42.31,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然这道料理 轻轻一嚼就化了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:45.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但令人惊讶的是完全不会让人有干巴巴的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:47.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,整块肉都十分富含水分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:50.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼的精华完全没有流失
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:54.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,对于食材的使用可能已经超越黑木场了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.43,0:15:55.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.07,0:15:56.11,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,真是厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:59.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明黑木场同学都是用鱼达人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:02.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,能理解我们之间的差距了么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:05.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么呢 你在选拔赛中制作的料理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:09.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 对了 是包烤秋刀鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:11.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那个也和这次的俄罗斯鲑鱼烤饼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:13.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把馅料也包起来一起烤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:17.32,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把食材的美味浓缩 融成一个整体的菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:20.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要让我来说的话 那样还是太过于天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:26.03,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,把食材的汁液完整保留下来的那种纤细而优美的加热
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.41,0:16:30.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这正是你这种家伙模仿不来的菁英的加热方法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:33.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这场食戟中 双方的力量差距是一目了然的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:36.08,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你们说对吧 审查员
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:41.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然从选拔那会儿起就什么都没变
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.30,0:16:46.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,用暴力的美味让食客的味觉屈服的厨师么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:49.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,明明有更加高雅的做法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:54.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,从今以后就在我们的旗下努力干活就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:57.43,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但是胜负还没决定不是么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:01.22,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,连两个人的菜品都没有吃的我都能明白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:05.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,莲太郎前辈说的话中有一点是错的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:17.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼的美味 鲜味还有风味
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.37,0:17:20.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,更加突出的是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:22.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这边的菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:26.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是黑木场凉的菜品
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:30.34,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,果然没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:34.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼的使用方法是黑木场更胜一筹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:35.44,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:36.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.10,0:17:39.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊 老爷爷你们在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我的火候是完美的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.23,0:17:44.85,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比那家伙的料理要次什么的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.85,0:17:46.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,啰啰嗦嗦的吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:50.45,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,无法接受的话就来尝一尝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:52.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我的鲑鱼烤饼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.06,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼 鲑鱼的鲜味像激流一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:09.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不断地向我涌过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:12.48,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会发生这样的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.67,0:18:13.93,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:17.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,面皮和馅之间有层绿色的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:19.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,让我告诉你吧 中枢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:23.51,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经和选拔赛那时的我已经不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:27.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那是把菠菜揉进去的可丽饼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:28.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可丽饼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.53,0:18:29.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.51,0:18:34.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,试吃时感觉到的那股轻柔的味道原来是菠菜的风味
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,将鲑鱼肉脂的醇厚一口气突显了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:40.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来好像美味得一塌糊涂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:44.41,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,奶油面包和可丽饼的双重构造真是令人吃惊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:47.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,并不止这些 在那股激流般的鲑鱼的鲜味之中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:50.02,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还有什么机关
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.13,0:18:54.40,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我在可丽饼上揉入特制的调味香料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:55.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,调味品…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:58.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是他独创的混合香辛料哟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:03.39,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,材料是百里香 牛至 蒜 岩盐等
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:06.55,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,还加入了干燥培根粉末
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:07.33,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,培根？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:09.42,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和我的鲑鱼料理一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:13.63,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到两者都在鲑鱼料理中用到了培根
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:17.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然着眼点相同 但呈现出来的内容却截然不同
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:21.70,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,楠是直接将培根卷在鲑鱼上面进行低温烹煮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:24.35,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,渐渐而优美地进行加热
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:27.83,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就像拉面界中必有的海鲜猪骨汤底一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鱼和肉的鲜味结合起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.28,0:19:33.46,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不放过任何一滴精华
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,换句话说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:38.19,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这是将鲑鱼的美味完美地保留在菜盘上的一道菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:41.95,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是这样 小莲的菜品是差在哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.02,0:19:44.58,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,关键在于「不均匀性」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:45.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不均匀性？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:46.89,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,人的舌头在品尝的东西的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.91,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,比起均匀混合的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:54.04,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,更加能够感觉到不均匀混合食物的醇厚和风味
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.17,0:19:56.60,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和拉面汤头上浮着的芝麻油与
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:20:00.16,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢加入牛奶的咖啡不搅匀了就喝的人比较多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是一个道理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:06.23,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,确实 鸡蛋拌饭也是随便拌一下会比较好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:09.94,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,酱油也是故意随便加会比较好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:12.82,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我追求的就是这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:16.66,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,故意把调味香料随意撒在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:20.18,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,便创造出只体现鲑鱼鲜味的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.21,0:20:25.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和与培根的鲜味紧紧交合在一起的味道浓郁的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.13,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:31.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,咀嚼的时候才会有层次感和重叠感在舌旁回响
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:35.78,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,鲑鱼所具有的味道才会不断地炸裂开来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:42.64,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,仅仅把培根卷在鲑鱼上是绝对表现不出那个味道的世界的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.81,0:20:46.15,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,乍一看 好像是楠更胜一筹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.61,0:20:50.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,但黑木场用面皮和可丽饼紧紧地锁住了鲜味
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:53.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,而且让鲑鱼的美味更上了一层楼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.95,0:20:58.21,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,居然想到故意将香料不均匀地撒上去的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:02.81,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你本来明明不过是只将鲜味混合在一起的厨师而已…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:07.05,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这么纤细的想法 选拔赛那会儿都根本就没有过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.73,0:21:08.96,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.73,0:21:11.72,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.10,0:21:15.47,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,你既然来到我的店铺进行实地研习
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:17.30,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就给我工作得再努力一些
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:18.28,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:21.84,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶啊 好来不来居然来了个咖喱店
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:25.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不愿想他 脑中也会浮现出香料混蛋的那张臭脸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.19,0:21:27.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我做好了 请检查
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:32.57,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行 你根本不明白香辛料的深度
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:36.53,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,要我选的话 真是想要选拔赛胜出的那个孩子过来帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.63,0:21:38.52,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子是香辛料的专家对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.58,0:21:39.92,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和你不同
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:44.36,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:45.99,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,贵安 凉君
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.10,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,有在好好地进行实地研习吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.07,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,一般吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.21,0:21:53.12,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,没有对店主大发雷霆吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.84,0:21:55.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,姑且…还没
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.73,0:21:58.50,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去会没完没了呢 我们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:02.24,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,因为一定要把选拔赛时候输掉的悔恨给清干净呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.66,0:22:03.54,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:05.14,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就做给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.37,0:22:06.97,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,既然来到这家店
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.28,0:22:11.59,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,就绝对要将香辛料的秘诀 使用方法变成自己的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:16.76,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,从选拔到现在什么都没变是不可能的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.01,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,黑木场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:20.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经和那时候的我不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:23.71,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,对现在的我来说 你的鲑鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.27,0:22:26.25,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,和冻结住的鲑鱼没什么区别
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.05,0:22:29.65,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,胜者是黑木场
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:32.86,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,黑木场凉胜出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,shokugeki_text,NTP,0,0,0,,
